// God Wars Dungeon: the rope down the shaft.
//
// Getting as far as the hole is gwd_surface.rs2's business - the boulder, the crack and the hole
// are all out on the battlefield. What is left here is the rope out of the chamber.
//
// OLD SCHOOL HAS A SHAFT FLOOR BETWEEN THE TWO and this build does not, because plane 3 of m45_82
// came across the graft with 2,061 locs and no terrain at all - every tile of it undrawn, no npc on
// any of it. So the hole goes straight to the chamber on plane 2 and this rope comes straight back
// out to the surface. gwd_rope_top, the "Climb-down" loc placed up on plane 3, is unreachable and
// stays that way until there is a floor for it to stand on.

[oploc1,gwd_rope_down]
mes("You climb up the rope, and out into the snow.");
anim(human_pickupfloor, 0);
p_delay(2);
p_telejump(^gwd_rope_topside);
